{comment: Verse 1}
[Em7]Lord of all creation, [C]
[Dsus4]of water, [Em7]earth and [C]sky;
[Dsus4]the heavens [Em7]are Your tabernacle; [C]
[Dsus4]glory to [Em7]the Lord on [C]high.

{comment: Verse 2}
[Em7]Early in the morning [C]
[Dsus4]I will [Em7]celebrate the [C]light.
[Dsus4]And as I [Em7]stumble in the darkness, [C]
[Dsus4]I will [Em7]call Your name by [C]night.

{comment: Chorus}
[G]God of wonders beyond our gala[D]xy. You are [Am7]holy, [C]holy;
